WEBVTT

00:02.597 --> 00:04.064
Legend has it...

00:05.199 --> 00:08.032
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.369 --> 00:13.705
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.176 --> 00:20.341
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.461 --> 00:40.867
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.135 --> 00:47.005
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.543 --> 00:54.448
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.117 --> 00:59.883
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.987 --> 01:03.184
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.961 --> 01:13.992
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.168 --> 01:20.038
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:20.908 --> 01:28.178
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.349 --> 01:36.757
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.458 --> 01:39.119
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.870 --> 01:52.306
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:53.975 --> 01:55.067
I have you!

02:04.485 --> 02:05.417
They've got me!

02:18.099 --> 02:22.900
<i>THE MUTSU CONSPIRACY</i>

02:26.540 --> 02:27.472
What do you think?

02:27.742 --> 02:30.233
Most likely, Jubei is here.

02:30.378 --> 02:31.845
Sure seems like it.

02:32.179 --> 02:34.272
I can sense his overpowering kenki...

02:34.515 --> 02:36.142
All right, let's go.

02:36.584 --> 02:37.608
Please wait.

02:38.019 --> 02:41.113
Don't tell me you're thinking
of going through the front door?

02:41.255 --> 02:41.846
Yes.

02:42.390 --> 02:45.154
No, let me find a way in first.

02:45.259 --> 02:46.920
You think you can sneak in?

02:47.128 --> 02:49.153
This is the home of
the famous Yagyu Clan...

02:49.297 --> 02:51.288
...plus, there's a
monster in there as well.

02:51.432 --> 02:54.196
My martial arts are one thing,
but as for my skills as a ninja...

02:54.468 --> 02:58.768
I still pride myself on
being the best there ever was!

02:59.640 --> 03:01.301
After I've infiltrated the house...

03:01.409 --> 03:05.743
...I want you to enter from the
front and create a disturbance.

03:05.880 --> 03:10.249
I will seize the opportunity
to rescue the Young Miss.

03:10.384 --> 03:10.850
Right.

03:11.185 --> 03:13.983
As for Lord Jubei, Mr. Takato...

03:14.221 --> 03:14.949
Huh?

03:15.756 --> 03:17.587
I am leaving him to you!

03:34.875 --> 03:38.777
Jubei, is what you told Matajuro true?

03:39.046 --> 03:40.308
It is true.

03:42.083 --> 03:45.575
Rather than striking out
blindly, perhaps I should try to...

03:45.686 --> 03:48.746
...glean something from
their conversation...

03:51.926 --> 03:55.054
Nothing will change your mind
about the Shogun's Tournament, then?

03:55.196 --> 03:57.687
So long as Musashi Miyamoto
will not be in competition...

03:57.832 --> 04:00.164
What kind of nonsense is that?

04:00.234 --> 04:01.758
Musashi may not be competing...

04:01.902 --> 04:03.893
...but he is sending his
adopted son Iori in his place.

04:04.305 --> 04:09.038
Do you know what Musashi
said when he recommended Iori?

04:09.443 --> 04:11.877
"In the event that Iori is defeated..."

04:11.979 --> 04:15.574
"...then I, Musashi,
will have been defeated."

04:15.683 --> 04:17.275
That is what he said.

04:17.718 --> 04:20.619
Before that, he also said this.

04:21.322 --> 04:24.485
"Though his skills are yet unpolished."

04:24.892 --> 04:25.790
What...

04:26.327 --> 04:31.287
I, Jubei, have no desire to duel a
man whose skills are not yet polished.

04:34.335 --> 04:36.496
Who's that? At this late hour!

04:36.837 --> 04:37.895
I'm busting in!

04:39.573 --> 04:41.598
Wait! Who the hell are you?

04:42.410 --> 04:44.378
I'm challenging your style.

04:46.213 --> 04:47.237
You challenge us?

04:47.348 --> 04:49.179
This is the Yagyu Shinkage Style...

04:49.283 --> 04:52.582
...the Shogun's official kenjutsu
style, and thus an exclusive style...

04:52.686 --> 04:55.587
...forbidden to duel outsiders.
Are you aware of that?

04:55.923 --> 04:57.550
What, you can't afford to lose?

04:57.758 --> 04:58.520
What!

04:58.726 --> 05:01.388
Daring to show up at
the Yagyu Dojo alone...

05:01.729 --> 05:03.754
I'll make you rue your own foolishness!

05:09.370 --> 05:10.064
What?

05:11.238 --> 05:13.365
If you're an intruder who has
trespassed under the cover of darkness...

05:13.474 --> 05:14.964
...we're not dealing
with an outside style.

05:15.109 --> 05:17.236
Men, kill the intruder!

05:18.846 --> 05:20.336
Finally got you in the mood, huh?

05:40.901 --> 05:41.890
Father...

05:42.403 --> 05:45.236
Rather than sending your unworthy son...

05:45.406 --> 05:48.136
...would it not be more
appropriate to compete yourself?

05:49.677 --> 05:52.407
You are the Sword Saint who
wields "The Sword That Gives Life."

05:52.646 --> 05:55.911
If you, Yagyu Tajima-no-kami
Munenori, represent the Yagyus...

05:56.117 --> 05:57.914
...surely you have nothing to fear.

05:58.352 --> 05:59.614
Or perhaps...

06:00.020 --> 06:02.682
Your so-called kenzen
ichinyo is just a pretext...

06:02.823 --> 06:06.725
...a sword for diplomacy, a
sword for political advancement?

06:08.129 --> 06:10.222
According to my cousin Hyogonosuke...

06:10.364 --> 06:14.801
...you are a man who has exchanged
his sword for political gain.

06:14.935 --> 06:16.732
Those were his words.

06:16.837 --> 06:19.032
Are those your true colors?

06:20.541 --> 06:24.068
You wouldn't understand...
not a man like you.

06:24.245 --> 06:25.803
No, I would not.

06:26.747 --> 06:29.147
All I know is that a
sword is nothing more than...

06:29.817 --> 06:33.014
...an instrument to kill.

06:45.699 --> 06:47.462
Has he detected me?

06:48.669 --> 06:49.931
Jubei...

06:50.571 --> 06:54.940
It was Matsudaira Izu-no-Kami's
idea to hold the Shogun's Tournament.

06:55.042 --> 06:57.840
His objective is to crush the Yagyus.

06:58.212 --> 07:01.340
He has felt slighted ever
since I was promoted from...

07:01.448 --> 07:04.144
...Sword Instructor to
Sometsuke the year before last.

07:04.552 --> 07:07.180
Undoubtedly, his scheme is
to see our style disgraced...

07:07.288 --> 07:08.949
...and for me to be stripped of my rank.

07:09.290 --> 07:12.782
Not only that, but the man pulling
the strings behind the scenes...

07:12.993 --> 07:16.121
...is that freak of a monk, Tenkai!

07:17.331 --> 07:20.858
I thought I'd been released at
last from Tenkai's influence...

07:21.001 --> 07:23.561
...when Shogun Hidetada passed away...

07:24.338 --> 07:29.037
To think that he's nearly 100,
and still thirsts for power...

07:29.677 --> 07:32.805
We cannot risk disgrace
at the Shogun's Tournament...

07:32.947 --> 07:37.350
...or else I will have taught
the Shogun nothing but lies.

07:37.818 --> 07:41.777
The Yagyus' existence depends
on the Shogun's favor, Jubei!

07:42.189 --> 07:48.059
I have no interest in mundane
affairs such as power disputes.

07:49.230 --> 07:50.197
I can't move.

07:50.965 --> 07:55.197
Facing off against an opponent who
might be more powerful than I...

07:55.269 --> 07:57.294
...that's all I'm interested in!

08:17.858 --> 08:21.988
Jubei, what if there was
someone more powerful than you...

08:22.229 --> 08:23.924
Would you compete then?

08:24.098 --> 08:29.126
Oh, so the match is more important
to you than the intruder up there?

08:29.703 --> 08:31.830
Are you familiar with the name Mutsu?

08:33.440 --> 08:38.639
True or not, the only man to
ever defeat the great Musashi...

08:39.113 --> 08:41.604
...that man's name was Mutsu...

08:42.149 --> 08:43.616
...that's what I have heard.

08:44.285 --> 08:47.049
And now Mutsu has reappeared...

08:47.288 --> 08:51.190
...or perhaps I should say,
one claiming to be a Mutsu...

08:51.325 --> 08:53.316
Really? So you've met this Mutsu?

08:53.627 --> 08:55.925
No, I have not...

08:56.063 --> 08:58.156
But there is a Mutsu at large...

08:59.600 --> 09:01.761
The Shogun is very interested
in seeing this technique.

09:01.902 --> 09:04.302
I'm sure Izu-no-Kami will find
this Mutsu person eventually...

09:04.605 --> 09:07.096
...to help him crush the Yagyu Clan!

09:13.647 --> 09:16.309
If this Mutsu should indeed turn up...

09:16.450 --> 09:18.918
...then it will be my
pleasure to take him on!

09:21.588 --> 09:23.385
Did you get that, ninja?

09:24.191 --> 09:28.252
If Izu-no-Kami is the master
you serve, tell him this...

09:28.595 --> 09:29.857
Izu-no-Kami...

09:30.364 --> 09:33.026
Jubei will definitely compete...

09:33.334 --> 09:38.829
...if you wish to destroy the Yagyu
Clan then be sure to find this Mutsu!

09:39.340 --> 09:42.400
I thought you'd killed the ninja.

09:42.876 --> 09:44.036
Why should I?

09:44.144 --> 09:46.374
He's not an inconvenience
to you, Father.

09:46.480 --> 09:49.540
Since I have decided
to compete after all!

09:55.289 --> 09:57.223
I was this close to losing my life...

09:58.258 --> 10:00.783
Still, I don't understand
what's going on.

10:01.195 --> 10:03.129
The Young Miss isn't here.

10:03.263 --> 10:06.755
If that's the case, then we
shouldn't be wasting any more time.

10:09.370 --> 10:10.769
M-Master?

10:11.071 --> 10:13.039
Just let the intruder go.

10:13.640 --> 10:14.971
Uh, well, actually...

10:15.642 --> 10:17.667
He's challenging our style.

10:18.212 --> 10:20.737
Idiot! We are an Otome Style...

10:20.881 --> 10:22.439
No challenges from outside styles!

10:22.583 --> 10:24.881
Do you know how late it
is? Why did you accept?

10:25.552 --> 10:26.883
Please forgive me.

10:27.020 --> 10:30.114
I did decline, but he
burst into the dojo anyway.

10:30.424 --> 10:34.451
Not only that, but this man
is unbelievably powerful...

10:38.332 --> 10:39.458
Lord Jubei...

10:40.501 --> 10:42.366
Wait, I shall go too!

10:48.709 --> 10:49.232
Well!

10:54.047 --> 10:55.571
I'm borrowing this from you...

10:56.683 --> 10:57.707
Jubei!

11:03.123 --> 11:06.149
We meet for the second time, eh?

11:07.227 --> 11:08.660
Maybe.

11:09.630 --> 11:13.191
Looks like I might not have to
compete in the tournament after all...

11:14.034 --> 11:15.433
What is going on here?

11:15.736 --> 11:16.794
Tell me your name...

11:16.937 --> 11:17.995
Takato.

11:18.172 --> 11:18.831
Last name?

11:18.972 --> 11:19.802
Don't have one.

11:19.973 --> 11:20.667
What?

11:20.774 --> 11:22.469
For now, at least.

11:23.377 --> 11:25.004
So he's not a Mutsu?

11:25.345 --> 11:28.473
If he were a Mutsu, then
he should be unarmed...

11:29.116 --> 11:31.744
Father, you are very fortunate.

11:31.885 --> 11:35.218
Apparently I shall have to take
part in the tournament after all...

11:36.123 --> 11:38.683
So many demons on the loose!

11:39.126 --> 11:40.684
Does that mean we're not gonna fight?

11:40.961 --> 11:42.895
But of course we are.

11:43.163 --> 11:47.065
In that case, you won't
be going to the tournament!

11:47.501 --> 11:50.937
Damn him, I thought he was one-eyed...

11:51.071 --> 11:53.665
...but he just had that eye closed shut.

11:55.275 --> 11:58.210
He took on these disciples of
the renowned Yagyu Style, and...

11:58.345 --> 12:02.975
...not one of them was skilled enough
to force him to fight with both eyes.

12:05.619 --> 12:06.586
Very interesting!

12:07.287 --> 12:09.551
You're a monster, Jubei.

12:09.990 --> 12:12.584
Can't believe how
strong your kenki is...

12:52.466 --> 12:53.626
Mr. Takato!

12:54.635 --> 12:57.103
The Young Miss is not
here. We must leave at once!

12:57.471 --> 13:00.702
Huh? Then where the
hell did they take her?

13:01.141 --> 13:02.904
Sorry to bother you, Jubei!

13:03.176 --> 13:04.404
You're not going anywhere.

13:04.545 --> 13:08.379
Sorry, but I don't have time
to entertain a monster like you.

13:09.149 --> 13:10.980
Thanks to that little moron!

13:14.354 --> 13:16.049
You're really going to run off?

13:16.189 --> 13:19.647
If we ever meet again, then
I promise I'll take you on.

13:19.793 --> 13:22.785
Then I'll tell you where
and when we'll meet.

13:24.264 --> 13:25.959
At the Shogun's Tournament...

13:27.100 --> 13:28.465
What do you say?

13:29.469 --> 13:30.936
You must be joking...

13:31.471 --> 13:33.029
No, I'm not joking.

13:33.340 --> 13:37.902
I'll use the Yagyu influence to
secure you a spot in the tournament...

13:38.278 --> 13:39.643
I'll be waiting for you!

13:40.380 --> 13:41.472
Jubei!

13:41.949 --> 13:45.180
I really don't give a damn
about the Shogun's Tournament.

13:45.319 --> 13:47.310
Perhaps not about the tournament itself...

13:47.654 --> 13:51.146
But I'm sure you give
a damn about facing me!

14:00.934 --> 14:03.300
I'm going to take that as a yes!

14:06.707 --> 14:07.901
He'll come.

14:08.075 --> 14:10.475
He's the same as me.

14:10.677 --> 14:14.010
An idiot who only seeks
a worthy opponent...

14:14.948 --> 14:17.109
I trust you have no objection, Father?

14:17.618 --> 14:18.812
Jubei...

14:18.952 --> 14:22.786
It looks like that ninja was
not one of Izu-no-Kami's...

14:23.156 --> 14:26.523
...but at least you'll be getting
your way in the end, Father.

14:26.727 --> 14:30.823
Since there's no question that I'll be
competing in the Shogun's Tournament.

14:33.133 --> 14:37.331
I don't know what misunderstanding
led him to the Yagyu residence...

14:37.604 --> 14:40.368
...but it was destiny that we met.

14:41.508 --> 14:43.032
The legendary Mutsu...

14:43.143 --> 14:44.770
Could it be him?

14:45.245 --> 14:49.511
I thought the tournament would be
a bore, but now I can hardly wait!

14:58.692 --> 15:00.557
I don't believe that guy.

15:00.727 --> 15:03.594
Now he's dragging me into
that damn tournament...

15:04.197 --> 15:05.960
Jubei Yagyu...

15:06.166 --> 15:09.829
I've got a feeling that's
a name I won't forget.

15:13.273 --> 15:14.638
Mr. Takato...

15:15.008 --> 15:16.498
So Jubei slashed you?

15:17.411 --> 15:19.106
Yes, he caught me off guard...

15:19.212 --> 15:22.545
It's the stress of losing
the Young Miss like this.

15:22.683 --> 15:24.810
I admit I'm quite flustered...

15:31.158 --> 15:35.185
But if it wasn't the Yagyus who snatched
her, then who could it have been?

15:35.495 --> 15:38.157
Well, we need to figure that out
before we make any more moves.

15:38.298 --> 15:41.756
I guess we'll have to put our
heads together, think of clues...

15:43.403 --> 15:45.701
If anything should
happen to the Young Miss...

15:45.839 --> 15:48.740
...I wouldn't be able to
face Lord Yukimura in heaven.

15:49.142 --> 15:54.136
So long as she's alive, I know she's
got the skills to survive on her own...

16:17.704 --> 16:21.105
So did you enjoy your bath, my dear?

16:21.241 --> 16:22.333
Yeah.

16:24.344 --> 16:26.539
Who the hell is this monk?

16:27.047 --> 16:32.178
He's obviously close to 100, but
his eyes are burning with ambition!

16:33.019 --> 16:35.453
So, what the hell is going on here?

16:35.689 --> 16:41.719
Now, now, a young lady like you shouldn't
have such a stern look on her face.

16:41.862 --> 16:45.161
Perhaps we were a bit
too rough with you...

16:45.298 --> 16:47.528
I really do apologize.

16:47.667 --> 16:51.535
All I said was to find out whether
or not you were truly a Mutsu...

16:51.705 --> 16:55.937
...and if you were, to bring you here.

16:56.476 --> 16:58.410
Isn't that right, Izu?

16:58.812 --> 16:59.870
lzu...

17:00.247 --> 17:01.612
Izu-no-Kami?

17:01.948 --> 17:03.882
Then that means this monk...

17:04.518 --> 17:07.112
...is the monster secretly
running the Bakufu...

17:07.287 --> 17:09.551
I hear Kakusuke and his men stooped to...

17:09.689 --> 17:12.624
...some low tactics to
ambush this young woman.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.355
Right, if they hadn't
attacked when they did...

17:15.495 --> 17:18.794
...then every last one of
them would be dead right now.

17:19.199 --> 17:23.067
Meaning that this myth of
unrivalled power, of invincibility...

17:23.203 --> 17:25.797
...is true even for a woman?

17:26.573 --> 17:27.972
Do you want me to show you?

17:29.142 --> 17:32.737
You shall show us later,
in the Shogun's Tournament!

17:33.113 --> 17:34.205
What?

17:34.648 --> 17:38.675
The Shogun himself wishes to see
the legendary Mutsu skills, you see...

17:39.386 --> 17:43.220
So my claim to the Mutsu name
is coming in handy after all...

17:47.494 --> 17:49.291
Did you get that, ninja?

17:50.263 --> 17:54.029
If Izu-no-Kami is the master
you serve, tell him this...

17:54.668 --> 17:57.296
Jubei will definitely compete...

17:57.437 --> 18:03.034
If you wish to destroy the Yagyu
Clan, then be sure to find this Mutsu!

18:03.410 --> 18:05.503
Matsudaira
Izu-no-Kami...

18:06.079 --> 18:09.446
If I recall correctly, Lord Munenori
mentioned he was looking for a...

18:09.583 --> 18:12.108
...Mutsu to help him
crush the Yagyu Clan.

18:12.686 --> 18:15.348
If that incident with
Lord Iori Miyamoto somehow...

18:15.488 --> 18:18.321
...reached the ears of
one of Izu-no-Kami's men...

18:18.458 --> 18:22.485
They went after her to see if
she was the real thing, huh?

18:22.863 --> 18:25.161
No more than a hunch of mine, but...

18:25.699 --> 18:28.862
As long as they believe she's
a Mutsu, she'll be safe...

18:29.269 --> 18:32.796
Most likely, if they've got her,
she'll be at his summer residence.

18:36.042 --> 18:38.602
I can't think of a greater honor, but...

18:39.412 --> 18:42.438
It'd be way too shallow of me
to take the bait so easily...

18:43.350 --> 18:44.578
I'm no idiot, you know.

18:44.951 --> 18:45.883
Hmm...

18:46.286 --> 18:48.481
I can tell you're much
too important just...

18:48.588 --> 18:51.056
...to be recruiting for
the Shogun's Tournament...

18:51.424 --> 18:54.018
You're the High Priest
Tenkai, aren't you...

18:54.294 --> 18:55.784
Too true, my dear.

18:55.929 --> 19:00.093
Nankobo Tenkai, that is my name.

19:07.340 --> 19:08.364
That's the place, over there!

19:09.175 --> 19:10.574
Look who's come to welcome us!

19:23.924 --> 19:25.755
Can you make it with that leg?

19:25.892 --> 19:27.223
This is nothing.

19:27.327 --> 19:30.262
As far as ninja skills
go, I still have no peer!

19:33.433 --> 19:36.527
What is it you want me to do
in the Shogun's Tournament?

19:36.870 --> 19:37.859
Hmm...

19:39.039 --> 19:40.370
The Yagyu Clan...

19:40.473 --> 19:43.499
They believe that no other
style exists but their own...

19:43.643 --> 19:45.770
Their arrogance is insufferable.

19:46.112 --> 19:49.013
And that's not all, either.

19:49.416 --> 19:53.079
All this talk about the Sword That
Gives Life or the Sword of Rulers...

19:53.887 --> 19:57.983
They deceive the Shogun
with such idle chatter...

19:58.158 --> 20:01.889
...to the point where he's now
interfering in political matters.

20:02.028 --> 20:07.728
Even I can hardly stand
to witness such behavior...

20:12.005 --> 20:14.667
I seek someone to teach Yagyu a lesson.

20:15.275 --> 20:18.836
In other words, this is nothing
more than a power struggle.

20:19.045 --> 20:20.137
In that case...

20:20.347 --> 20:21.439
1,000 ryo!

20:21.681 --> 20:25.481
For defeating the Yagyu clan, and
grinding their arrogance under my heels.

20:25.919 --> 20:27.784
It's a small price to pay
for control of the nation!

20:28.521 --> 20:32.753
Very well... but only after
you've won, mind you.

20:33.360 --> 20:34.418
It's settled.

20:34.561 --> 20:35.994
All right, then, I'm going home.

20:36.196 --> 20:37.185
Please wait.

20:37.297 --> 20:40.892
I'd like you to be my guest here
until the day of the tournament.

20:41.101 --> 20:44.161
Thank you for the invitation, but
I've got companions, you see...

20:44.571 --> 20:45.503
Kakusuke!

20:48.041 --> 20:50.771
Kakusuke's that head ninja of yours?

20:51.544 --> 20:54.741
Hey Kakusuke, if you fall asleep
on the job, you'll get fired!

20:58.885 --> 21:00.250
What the hell?

21:00.820 --> 21:02.720
I bet the food here is outstanding...

21:03.023 --> 21:03.546
Huh?

21:03.656 --> 21:04.623
What?

21:05.225 --> 21:09.457
She's going to stay, that's
what she means, Izu...

21:09.796 --> 21:12.492
Right. Since my
companions have arrived...

21:13.433 --> 21:21.340
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.485 --> 21:44.522
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.798 --> 21:54.537
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.674 --> 22:03.673
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.817 --> 22:14.489
<i>Even if it's just hello,
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.528 --> 22:21.660
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.001 --> 22:25.027
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.905 --> 22:32.174
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.479 --> 22:37.974
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.465 --> 22:54.797
Tsubura and Sasuke are
out to kill Iemitsu...

22:54.934 --> 22:57.528
Meanwhile, Takato
decides to take on Jubei...

22:57.637 --> 22:59.867
What fate awaits them at
the Shogun's Tournament?

23:00.473 --> 23:02.100
Next episode of Age of Chaos.

23:02.208 --> 23:03.971
<i>THE ROARING CASCADE</i>

23:04.077 --> 23:05.977
Pay close attention, and wait!
